# decisions/

Per-decision markdown files. Populates as non-trivial decisions get filed.

Schema per FRAMEWORK.md Section 4.4:
- Frontmatter: type: decision, status: active|superseded|pending, date: YYYY-MM-DD
- Body: title, context, options considered, choice, rationale, tradeoffs, consequences
- Wikilinks to every affected person and project (non-negotiable — see Section 4.4 wikilink rule)

Filename convention: descriptive title, no date prefix (date lives in frontmatter).
